WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:03.280
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.280 --> 00:05.870
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.540 --> 00:09.940
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.640 --> 00:14.650
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.020 --> 00:17.550
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:17.890 --> 00:21.330
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.080 --> 00:28.300
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:28.980 --> 00:34.060
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:34.860 --> 00:37.350
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.350 --> 00:39.960
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.480 --> 00:47.740
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.710 --> 00:51.470
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.530 --> 00:54.370
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.660 --> 00:55.690
♪Let me♪

00:55.880 --> 00:59.960
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.410 --> 01:03.090
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.380 --> 01:06.080
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.250 --> 01:07.720
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.720 --> 01:11.890
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.250 --> 01:22.500
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:23.930 --> 01:29.480
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.680 --> 01:32.560
=Episode 18=

02:27.430 --> 02:28.350
Thank you, Commander.

02:29.230 --> 02:30.110
Last night,

02:30.630 --> 02:31.829
I behaved too boldly.

02:35.950 --> 02:36.660
It's nothing.

02:37.390 --> 02:38.350
No one saw us anyway.

02:39.190 --> 02:40.630
Even if seen, it wouldn't matter.

02:41.270 --> 02:43.829
The Qiao couple spent
the night on a sampan.

02:44.030 --> 02:44.750
If word spreads,

02:45.150 --> 02:46.310
it'll be a romantic story.

02:49.270 --> 02:49.950
Then we will

02:50.630 --> 02:51.990
leave openly in the crowds

02:52.790 --> 02:53.950
conspicuously.

03:01.990 --> 03:02.540
Commander.

03:02.910 --> 03:03.590
Are you alright?

03:05.310 --> 03:06.110
It's my fault.

03:06.590 --> 03:08.390
I lay on your arm all night

03:08.510 --> 03:09.790
and made your hand go numb.

03:10.510 --> 03:11.590
It's fine. Really.

03:14.550 --> 03:15.230
You don't need me

03:15.230 --> 03:16.390
to massage it for you?

03:17.110 --> 03:18.110
Stop being stubborn.

03:30.870 --> 03:31.590
Flatbread.

03:32.590 --> 03:33.190
Flatbread.

03:33.270 --> 03:33.870
Flatbread.

03:34.310 --> 03:35.150
I want flatbread.

03:37.230 --> 03:37.750
Sir.

03:38.510 --> 03:39.670
Two flatbreads, please.

03:40.030 --> 03:40.590
Alright.

03:40.710 --> 03:41.470
A pot of hot tea.

03:44.230 --> 03:44.870
Your hot tea.

03:45.030 --> 03:45.620
Thank you.

03:45.950 --> 03:46.590
Your flatbreads.

03:46.950 --> 03:47.600
Enjoy.

04:05.950 --> 04:06.550
Commander.

04:07.270 --> 04:08.350
Freshly baked flatbreads.

04:09.550 --> 04:10.430
Don't you want to try?

04:13.470 --> 04:14.030
Not hungry.

04:15.070 --> 04:16.269
Such a stick-in-the-mud.

04:33.510 --> 04:34.270
Unlike a Wei man.

04:34.870 --> 04:35.909
When drinking tea earlier,

04:36.550 --> 04:37.790
he added salt,

04:38.150 --> 04:38.590
ginger,

04:39.070 --> 04:39.670
and pepper.

04:39.710 --> 04:40.230
Exactly.

04:40.870 --> 04:41.950
That's a Wutuo custom.

04:42.430 --> 04:43.430
It's used to fight

04:43.670 --> 04:44.350
the cold.

05:12.150 --> 05:12.990
This Wutuo man

05:13.110 --> 05:14.190
has accomplices.

05:14.670 --> 05:15.790
They're leaving the city.

05:16.110 --> 05:17.270
Should we follow?

05:22.630 --> 05:23.590
Look at those two.

05:27.590 --> 05:29.110
Though the girl is coughing violently,

05:29.710 --> 05:30.390
her grandmother

05:30.390 --> 05:31.390
shows no concern.

05:31.950 --> 05:33.190
She's gripping the girl's hand

05:33.710 --> 05:35.110
like fearing an escape.

05:35.550 --> 05:36.670
That old woman's suspicious.

05:37.150 --> 05:38.110
Intercept her.

05:40.350 --> 05:40.870
Stop!

05:46.710 --> 05:47.909
Hand over the girl.

05:49.230 --> 05:50.270
Surrender quietly,

05:50.590 --> 05:51.710
and I'll spare your life.

05:53.270 --> 05:54.390
If I can't take this girl,

05:54.710 --> 05:56.350
she'll die here.

06:24.190 --> 06:25.710
These Wutuo people are cunning.

06:28.950 --> 06:29.510
He.

06:30.990 --> 06:31.510
Master.

06:33.830 --> 06:34.590
Let's leave first.

06:35.390 --> 06:35.950
Follow me.

06:41.590 --> 06:43.670
Master, what happened earlier?

06:44.110 --> 06:45.150
Who's this girl?

06:45.750 --> 06:46.430
That old woman

06:46.710 --> 06:47.710
was a Wutuo spy

06:47.710 --> 06:48.830
infiltrating Jiyang.

06:49.270 --> 06:49.870
I've been

06:50.110 --> 06:50.909
tracking them

06:50.909 --> 06:51.830
for some time.

06:52.950 --> 06:53.830
This child

06:53.950 --> 06:55.230
is Princess Mengji's daughter.

06:55.909 --> 06:57.550
They nearly abducted her earlier.

06:58.070 --> 06:59.430
No wonder Cui Yuezhi's frantic.

07:00.390 --> 07:01.070
I'll return first

07:01.510 --> 07:02.310
to report finding

07:02.470 --> 07:04.070
the kid and the Wutuo spies.

07:04.670 --> 07:05.750
Go with your master

07:05.830 --> 07:06.590
to escort the kid.

07:11.150 --> 07:11.910
Stay vigilant.

07:19.010 --> 07:20.720
(Herbal Apothecary)

07:32.110 --> 07:32.870
To locate

07:32.870 --> 07:33.830
that injured Wutuo man,

07:34.110 --> 07:35.470
we searched many apothecaries

07:35.830 --> 07:37.230
but found no trace.

07:37.510 --> 07:38.100
No rush.

07:38.550 --> 07:39.190
He must still be

07:39.710 --> 07:40.470
in Jiyang.

07:43.200 --> 07:45.810
(Herb Names)

08:02.150 --> 08:03.230
That's him.

08:05.870 --> 08:06.430
Follow him.

08:26.830 --> 08:28.070
I was wondering earlier

08:29.070 --> 08:30.510
why the Wutuo people spared me.

08:32.880 --> 08:34.220
(Xu)

08:35.309 --> 08:36.150
Later, I found out

08:36.510 --> 08:37.150
it was

08:37.190 --> 08:38.070
because they saw

08:38.630 --> 08:39.350
the Xu token.

08:40.190 --> 08:40.909
Judging by this,

08:41.309 --> 08:42.950
they are connected to Chancellor Xu,

08:43.190 --> 08:44.790
perhaps even acting under his orders.

08:47.110 --> 08:48.310
For Chai Anxi,

08:48.550 --> 08:50.030
so many Wutuo agents have come here.

08:50.470 --> 08:51.550
I fear Jiyang City

08:52.270 --> 08:53.230
is headed for turmoil.

08:53.600 --> 09:00.590
(Cloudbird Manor)

09:03.830 --> 09:04.710
Cloudbird Manor?

09:05.590 --> 09:06.870
Master, why here?

09:07.230 --> 09:08.590
This child's been drugged.

09:09.070 --> 09:09.790
I must go inside

09:09.790 --> 09:10.830
to prepare an antidote.

09:11.630 --> 09:12.190
Bring her

09:12.350 --> 09:13.030
and follow me in.

09:37.030 --> 09:37.750
Earlier,

09:37.950 --> 09:39.310
who was that gentleman?

09:40.910 --> 09:41.490
Also,

09:41.910 --> 09:43.190
why change into women's clothes?

09:45.830 --> 09:47.990
He's General Fengyun, Xiao Jue.

09:48.670 --> 09:49.510
We came to Jiyang

09:49.790 --> 09:50.630
on official business.

09:51.310 --> 09:52.390
As for the clothing change,

09:52.950 --> 09:54.070
it's to conceal my identity.

09:56.590 --> 09:58.510
So that's General Fengyun.

09:59.710 --> 10:00.790
No wonder he immediately

10:00.950 --> 10:02.030
started giving you orders.

10:03.790 --> 10:05.070
He's the Right Army Commander.

10:05.430 --> 10:06.190
I'm just one

10:06.190 --> 10:06.870
of his soldiers.

10:07.190 --> 10:08.390
Of course he can order me.

10:10.670 --> 10:12.070
You seem quite protective of him.

10:12.950 --> 10:13.520
What?

10:13.950 --> 10:14.590
Do you like him?

10:24.830 --> 10:25.590
Between us,

10:26.630 --> 10:27.870
there's indeed some history.

10:29.550 --> 10:30.470
But my own path

10:31.270 --> 10:32.190
is not yet clear.

10:33.750 --> 10:34.470
I suppose

10:35.470 --> 10:36.830
nothing will come of it.

10:39.830 --> 10:41.750
Let me divine

10:41.870 --> 10:42.510
your fates.

11:24.190 --> 11:25.990
The hexagram is Kan.

11:26.950 --> 11:27.950
It represents water.

11:28.470 --> 11:29.670
From peril to greater peril.

11:30.110 --> 11:31.190
Trapped between dangers

11:31.430 --> 11:32.390
with no escape in sight.

11:33.750 --> 11:34.590
Does this mean

11:35.630 --> 11:37.070
being with him would bring

11:37.470 --> 11:38.590
certain disaster?

11:44.230 --> 11:45.190
Remember what I said

11:45.190 --> 11:46.110
earlier?

11:46.870 --> 11:47.790
It signifies danger,

11:48.230 --> 11:49.990
but water is adaptable.

11:50.390 --> 11:51.750
Navigate through hazards

11:52.150 --> 11:53.470
and find passage in peril.

11:57.870 --> 11:58.830
Human conquers fate.

11:59.510 --> 12:00.510
Don't bow to destiny.

12:52.830 --> 12:54.430
That melody sounds so familiar.

12:54.910 --> 12:56.510
My mother often plays this

12:56.750 --> 12:58.150
in her leisure time.

12:59.030 --> 13:00.150
I think it's called

13:01.110 --> 13:02.270
Slow Passing Years.

13:08.450 --> 13:12.110
(Cloudbird Manor)

13:23.430 --> 13:25.310
(Clouds and birds fade from memory.)

13:26.270 --> 13:28.870
(One day, we'll reunite
at the city tower.)

13:30.030 --> 13:30.870
(Cloudbird Manor.)

13:31.830 --> 13:32.990
(So that's how it is.)

13:35.620 --> 13:41.220
(Cloudbird Manor)

13:48.070 --> 13:48.790
Mr. Cui,

13:49.070 --> 13:50.150
you've finally arrived.

13:54.150 --> 13:54.950
Sorry for the delay.

13:55.230 --> 13:56.750
Are you okay?

13:57.430 --> 13:57.950
I nearly

13:58.030 --> 13:58.830
came close to

13:58.830 --> 13:59.750
being killed.

14:00.150 --> 14:01.710
Mr. Liu saved me.

14:04.750 --> 14:05.870
I'm Cui Yuezhi.

14:06.310 --> 14:07.150
My deepest gratitude

14:07.270 --> 14:08.790
for saving the little princess.

14:09.030 --> 14:10.470
Thanks to your information

14:10.750 --> 14:12.030
about the Wutuo spies,

14:12.350 --> 14:12.990
I've sent people

14:13.150 --> 14:14.110
to catch them.

14:14.510 --> 14:15.230
It was nothing.

14:15.590 --> 14:16.630
Don't mention it.

14:17.150 --> 14:17.910
You'd better return

14:18.470 --> 14:19.590
with the little princess.

14:19.910 --> 14:20.550
We shouldn't let

14:20.950 --> 14:22.030
her elders worry.

14:22.790 --> 14:23.470
Of course.

14:23.910 --> 14:25.270
I should report this

14:25.430 --> 14:26.350
to Princess Mengji.

14:26.870 --> 14:27.670
Would you

14:27.670 --> 14:28.510
accompany me?

14:29.470 --> 14:30.350
When she learns

14:30.350 --> 14:31.750
of your heroic deed,

14:32.350 --> 14:34.150
she'll surely reward you generously.

14:35.670 --> 14:36.550
I avoid worldly ties.

14:37.010 --> 14:37.550
No need.

14:38.550 --> 14:39.590
Alright, alright.

14:40.870 --> 14:41.470
Your Highness.

14:41.910 --> 14:42.480
After you.

14:45.270 --> 14:45.950
Mr. Liu.

14:46.310 --> 14:47.030
Visit me sometime.

14:56.550 --> 14:57.070
He.

14:57.830 --> 14:58.470
You two

14:58.750 --> 14:59.510
may return.

14:59.950 --> 15:00.590
Be careful.

15:01.950 --> 15:02.630
- Yes.
- Yes.

15:12.470 --> 15:13.100
What's wrong?

15:14.630 --> 15:15.230
Your master

15:15.750 --> 15:17.350
cares a lot about the little princess.

15:18.790 --> 15:21.270
He rarely speaks of the past.

15:22.190 --> 15:23.430
But I can sense

15:23.950 --> 15:25.710
he harbors many regrets in his heart

15:26.030 --> 15:26.830
and sorrows.

15:28.430 --> 15:29.790
I don't want to see him sad.

15:30.350 --> 15:30.910
That's why

15:31.990 --> 15:33.150
I never mention it.

15:39.080 --> 15:41.510
(Mengji Mansion, Jiyang)

15:41.510 --> 15:46.020
(Cultivate Virtue)

15:58.110 --> 15:58.870
The little princess

15:59.070 --> 16:00.310
entered to see Princess Mengji.

16:00.550 --> 16:01.470
We'll wait here

16:01.670 --> 16:03.030
for her summons.

16:04.230 --> 16:04.790
Uncle.

16:05.310 --> 16:06.070
Tell us

16:06.110 --> 16:07.030
about Princess Mengji,

16:07.430 --> 16:08.670
so we don't offend her later.

16:11.270 --> 16:12.190
Back then,

16:12.470 --> 16:14.710
the old lord had a son and a daughter.

16:16.150 --> 16:18.150
The eldest son died before 18.

16:18.990 --> 16:20.390
In those days, the Mengji Mansion

16:20.430 --> 16:22.550
was like a boat in stormy seas.

16:23.270 --> 16:24.910
To stabilize the situation, the Princess

16:25.230 --> 16:26.990
married the son
of a high-ranking official.

16:27.550 --> 16:28.670
After her husband's death,

16:29.070 --> 16:30.430
she took charge of governance,

16:30.710 --> 16:31.870
quelled internal conflicts,

16:32.350 --> 16:33.230
won over the people,

16:33.750 --> 16:34.910
and steered

16:35.270 --> 16:36.830
Jiyang's slow return to stability.

16:39.390 --> 16:41.630
The Princess arrives!

16:59.890 --> 17:04.109
(Mu Hongjin, Princess Mengji)

17:04.670 --> 17:05.990
I'm Cui Yuezhi.

17:06.190 --> 17:07.310
Your Highness.

17:08.190 --> 17:08.910
Huanqing, Yuyan,

17:09.109 --> 17:10.190
greet the Princess.

17:14.829 --> 17:15.829
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

17:18.430 --> 17:19.190
Mr. Cui.

17:19.790 --> 17:20.550
These two

17:20.910 --> 17:22.349
are your long-lost nephew

17:22.390 --> 17:24.069
and niece-in-law?

17:25.349 --> 17:26.109
Your Highness,

17:26.550 --> 17:27.390
this young man

17:27.550 --> 17:29.230
is my nephew, Huanqing.

17:29.790 --> 17:30.590
Beside him

17:30.630 --> 17:32.110
stands this lovely and dutiful lady,

17:32.310 --> 17:33.750
his recently wedded wife,

17:33.830 --> 17:34.430
Yuyan.

17:35.550 --> 17:36.710
Huanqing

17:36.950 --> 17:39.230
is handsome, clever, and skilled in

17:39.310 --> 17:40.630
both civil and martial arts.

17:41.350 --> 17:42.390
His demeanor

17:42.590 --> 17:44.710
greatly resembles my late elder brother.

17:45.030 --> 17:46.230
Every time I see him,

17:46.630 --> 17:49.630
I'm filled with melancholy.

17:50.350 --> 17:51.670
I never realized

17:52.190 --> 17:53.910
the Right Army Commander had free time

17:54.510 --> 17:56.270
to impersonate someone

17:57.270 --> 17:58.550
to come to my place?

18:05.710 --> 18:06.870
You old fool.

18:07.270 --> 18:09.190
Falling for such an obvious deception.

18:09.590 --> 18:11.110
He resembles your dead brother?

18:11.510 --> 18:12.910
Have you looked in a mirror?

18:13.590 --> 18:14.910
Your family

18:15.310 --> 18:16.670
are never known

18:17.030 --> 18:17.990
for handsomeness.

18:17.990 --> 18:18.610
I...

18:22.990 --> 18:24.430
Please stop

18:24.710 --> 18:25.790
beating around the bush.

18:26.390 --> 18:27.790
Why did you infiltrate Jiyang City?

18:28.430 --> 18:30.270
What's your true purpose?

18:31.390 --> 18:32.590
My apologies, Your Highness.

18:33.590 --> 18:34.750
My visit here

18:35.310 --> 18:36.510
aims to find someone.

18:37.430 --> 18:38.510
Chai Anxi,

18:39.150 --> 18:40.390
once my father's subordinate,

18:40.990 --> 18:42.470
went missing in the Mingshui Battle.

18:43.550 --> 18:44.830
After tracking him all this way,

18:45.550 --> 18:46.430
I had no choice

18:46.910 --> 18:47.830
but to hide my identity

18:48.150 --> 18:48.910
to enter Jiyang.

18:49.990 --> 18:51.750
Mr. Cui was kept in the dark.

18:52.790 --> 18:53.430
Your Highness,

18:53.630 --> 18:54.470
please forgive him.

18:55.830 --> 18:57.390
Is that your excuse?

18:57.830 --> 18:58.590
Do you know

18:58.990 --> 18:59.870
nowadays, Jiyang

19:00.510 --> 19:01.830
has been infiltrated

19:01.830 --> 19:02.750
by many Wutuo spies?

19:04.190 --> 19:05.110
Is this true?

19:05.790 --> 19:07.350
Jiyang City is impenetrable.

19:07.870 --> 19:09.110
How did they infiltrate?

19:10.230 --> 19:10.910
Your Highness,

19:11.310 --> 19:12.830
as General Xiao mentioned,

19:13.110 --> 19:13.750
the Wutuo people

19:13.910 --> 19:15.150
used unknown methods

19:15.390 --> 19:16.430
to infiltrate Jiyang City.

19:17.030 --> 19:19.070
They ambushed the little princess

19:19.510 --> 19:20.510
during her outing,

19:20.910 --> 19:21.590
probably

19:21.790 --> 19:22.710
to blackmail you.

19:23.350 --> 19:24.470
Please don't worry.

19:24.670 --> 19:26.270
I've deployed people to capture

19:26.510 --> 19:27.510
the Wutuo spies.

19:28.150 --> 19:29.350
Given current circumstances,

19:29.750 --> 19:31.110
merely catching them

19:31.670 --> 19:32.390
won't suffice.

19:32.870 --> 19:33.950
What's your proposal?

19:34.430 --> 19:35.350
As you said,

19:35.990 --> 19:37.150
Jiyang is impenetrable

19:37.470 --> 19:38.270
as the world knows.

19:38.750 --> 19:39.430
But now,

19:40.190 --> 19:41.390
the Wutuo agents have managed

19:41.430 --> 19:42.670
to infiltrate effortlessly

19:43.350 --> 19:44.670
and target the little princess.

19:45.270 --> 19:46.030
This proves

19:46.830 --> 19:48.070
their actions are premeditated

19:48.910 --> 19:49.990
and well-prepared.

19:51.630 --> 19:52.210
Your Highness,

19:52.790 --> 19:54.550
for Jiyang's citizens' safety,

19:55.150 --> 19:56.470
we must prepare early

19:56.790 --> 19:57.670
and take precautions.

19:58.550 --> 19:59.790
This is our business.

20:01.030 --> 20:02.350
We'll handle it ourselves.

20:08.550 --> 20:09.110
Your Highness,

20:09.350 --> 20:11.110
Military Inspector Chu Zhao is outside.

20:13.910 --> 20:14.590
Let him in.

20:29.630 --> 20:30.310
Your Highness.

20:30.590 --> 20:31.670
Skip formalities.

20:32.270 --> 20:33.710
Why would a military inspector

20:34.110 --> 20:35.870
visit Jiyang?

20:36.430 --> 20:37.830
Are you sent by the court?

20:39.350 --> 20:40.150
You misunderstand.

20:40.470 --> 20:41.590
I'm returning to the capital

20:42.110 --> 20:43.190
and merely passing through.

20:45.030 --> 20:46.230
Then why request this meeting?

20:46.750 --> 20:47.350
I

20:48.630 --> 20:50.110
spotted a Wutuo spy.

20:59.110 --> 20:59.710
Where?

21:00.670 --> 21:01.550
At an herb shop.

21:02.030 --> 21:02.870
A wounded man had

21:03.270 --> 21:04.430
a wolf-head tattoo

21:04.950 --> 21:05.670
on his right arm,

21:05.910 --> 21:07.510
a Wutuo identifier,

21:07.630 --> 21:08.670
revealed during treatment.

21:09.390 --> 21:10.390
I tracked him

21:10.870 --> 21:12.430
to a group of Wutuo spies.

21:13.070 --> 21:14.070
There were over a dozen.

21:15.750 --> 21:16.310
Clearly,

21:16.790 --> 21:17.790
multiple Wutuo groups

21:17.790 --> 21:18.670
have infiltrated

21:19.270 --> 21:20.070
this city.

21:21.350 --> 21:22.670
Please reconsider

21:23.510 --> 21:24.070
my proposal,

21:24.830 --> 21:26.470
Your Highness.

21:27.590 --> 21:28.830
We appreciate your warning.

21:29.630 --> 21:30.670
But we'll handle

21:31.310 --> 21:33.030
our own affairs.

21:33.550 --> 21:34.230
You may leave.

21:34.510 --> 21:36.470
Host them at the mansion tonight.

21:50.440 --> 21:52.580
(Self-Revealing Virtue)

21:56.190 --> 21:57.270
Mr. Qiao?

21:59.150 --> 22:00.470
I didn't expect you in Jiyang

22:00.790 --> 22:01.790
under a new name.

22:03.030 --> 22:03.550
There's more.

22:04.190 --> 22:05.190
I've even gotten married.

22:07.550 --> 22:08.110
Mr. Chu,

22:08.630 --> 22:09.670
we're destined to meet

22:09.950 --> 22:10.790
wherever we go.

22:12.350 --> 22:13.190
Putting it that way,

22:13.630 --> 22:15.470
it seems we're always reuniting.

22:15.910 --> 22:17.350
Then you must be very busy, Mr. Chu.

22:17.710 --> 22:18.750
Even crossing a street

22:19.150 --> 22:20.190
would make you reunite

22:20.310 --> 22:21.430
with many 'destined ones'.

22:31.870 --> 22:33.110
Commander, night approaches.

22:33.310 --> 22:34.190
Let's dine.

22:47.270 --> 22:48.710
Xiao Jue's arrival was abrupt

22:48.830 --> 22:49.710
and impolite.

22:50.150 --> 22:51.390
But a general of his caliber

22:51.590 --> 22:52.710
never acts rashly.

22:53.230 --> 22:54.270
Mobilize defenses,

22:54.510 --> 22:56.110
increase patrols and drills,

22:56.390 --> 22:57.350
and stockpile herbs

22:57.510 --> 22:58.190
just in case.

22:59.070 --> 23:00.230
Understood.

23:00.750 --> 23:01.390
Moreover,

23:02.110 --> 23:03.310
he saved Lou.

23:04.110 --> 23:05.430
Keep his presence here

23:05.670 --> 23:06.430
confidential.

23:07.350 --> 23:08.350
Help his search

23:08.790 --> 23:09.710
for the person.

23:11.470 --> 23:12.050
Yes.

23:18.690 --> 23:23.600
(Self-Revealing Virtue)

23:48.390 --> 23:49.310
Slow Passing Years.

24:14.270 --> 24:15.150
Your Highness.

24:16.950 --> 24:17.790
Slow Passing Years.

24:19.030 --> 24:20.670
Have you heard this song?

24:22.310 --> 24:23.390
My master often plays it.

24:26.230 --> 24:28.390
I heard Lou mention it.

24:28.910 --> 24:29.590
Her savior

24:30.150 --> 24:31.590
also included a white-clad hero

24:32.150 --> 24:33.190
with a sword in hand

24:33.390 --> 24:34.630
and a zither on his back.

24:35.830 --> 24:36.710
Do you know

24:37.510 --> 24:38.430
who he might be?

24:40.230 --> 24:41.310
That was my master

24:41.710 --> 24:43.670
Liu Buwang, the Cloudforest Hermit.

24:47.830 --> 24:48.670
Liu Buwang?

24:51.190 --> 24:51.990
Is he well?

24:54.430 --> 24:55.020
No.

24:56.030 --> 24:56.990
No need to tell me.

24:57.990 --> 24:58.790
I don't care.

25:03.670 --> 25:04.790
May I ask you

25:05.510 --> 25:06.430
if you

25:07.110 --> 25:08.230
and my master

25:09.390 --> 25:10.590
were once acquainted?

25:15.110 --> 25:16.350
(Many years ago,)

25:17.390 --> 25:18.510
(to escape my marriage,)

25:19.670 --> 25:21.030
(I secretly fled the mansion.)

25:28.270 --> 25:29.430
Run faster, little lady!

25:29.550 --> 25:31.600
- Try running!
- Where can you flee now?

25:31.600 --> 25:33.990
Help! Is anyone there to save me?

25:34.230 --> 25:34.910
Run!

25:35.790 --> 25:36.350
Scream!

25:36.470 --> 25:37.630
Yeah, keep running!

25:54.510 --> 25:55.020
Sir.

25:55.590 --> 25:56.550
Help me, sir!

25:57.190 --> 25:58.350
Carrying a zither?

25:59.150 --> 26:00.030
You fragile man

26:00.070 --> 26:01.590
want to be a hero?

26:01.990 --> 26:02.590
Scram.

26:03.830 --> 26:04.510
Sir.

26:05.550 --> 26:06.190
Still here?

26:06.830 --> 26:07.390
Get him!

26:23.190 --> 26:23.950
Sir.

26:46.150 --> 26:47.030
Thank you.

26:47.750 --> 26:48.750
I'm Mu Hongjin.

26:49.190 --> 26:50.270
What's your name?

26:52.870 --> 26:53.510
Liu Buwang.

26:54.030 --> 26:54.950
If you're unharmed,

26:55.190 --> 26:56.190
I'll take my leave.

26:57.550 --> 26:58.430
Mr. Liu.

27:01.670 --> 27:03.270
I think my ankle's sprained.

27:04.230 --> 27:05.070
In for a penny,

27:05.430 --> 27:06.310
in for a pound.

27:06.990 --> 27:07.550
How about

27:08.350 --> 27:09.150
you carry me?

27:09.310 --> 27:09.900
No.

27:10.910 --> 27:11.550
That's improper.

27:15.510 --> 27:16.830
It really does hurt

27:17.070 --> 27:18.270
when I move.

27:21.190 --> 27:22.750
Please, sir.

27:32.030 --> 27:32.560
Miss,

27:32.990 --> 27:33.710
where's your home?

27:34.350 --> 27:35.150
I'll take you back.

27:35.390 --> 27:36.310
I have no home.

27:36.790 --> 27:38.150
I was kidnapped and brought here.

27:38.710 --> 27:40.750
My home is very far away.

27:41.390 --> 27:42.470
I'll follow you.

27:42.790 --> 27:44.190
Wherever you go, I go.

27:44.750 --> 27:45.750
What do you mean

27:45.750 --> 27:46.550
by "follow me"?

27:47.350 --> 27:48.350
Why would you follow me?

27:49.230 --> 27:50.430
Since you saved me,

27:50.710 --> 27:51.990
see it through to the end.

27:53.350 --> 27:54.950
Or escort me home.

27:55.470 --> 27:56.430
My home is far away.

27:56.670 --> 27:57.350
Can you do it?

27:57.470 --> 27:58.060
Of course.

27:59.870 --> 28:01.150
My home's in Yaojing.

28:04.870 --> 28:05.710
Don't worry.

28:05.830 --> 28:06.950
I don't eat much.

28:07.030 --> 28:08.430
I won't cost you much.

28:08.590 --> 28:09.350
Having me along

28:09.470 --> 28:10.590
won't be a burden.

28:11.590 --> 28:12.190
No.

28:14.550 --> 28:16.270
Please, please.

28:19.230 --> 28:20.670
I'm begging you.

28:42.830 --> 28:43.430
Thank you.

29:39.510 --> 29:40.270
I'm starving.

29:40.790 --> 29:41.550
Sir.

29:42.070 --> 29:43.870
Can we have a proper meal?

29:44.510 --> 29:45.040
No.

29:45.430 --> 29:46.230
After a month,

29:46.630 --> 29:47.790
my money is nearly gone.

29:49.910 --> 29:51.830
Candied haws for sale!

29:53.790 --> 29:54.630
Candied haws.

29:54.790 --> 29:55.390
Want one?

29:56.150 --> 29:56.750
Take a look.

30:01.630 --> 30:02.990
Sir, one please.

30:03.390 --> 30:04.310
Alright. Thank you.

30:05.430 --> 30:06.190
Here, hold this.

30:15.750 --> 30:17.030
You still care about me.

30:17.350 --> 30:17.910
Want some?

30:19.030 --> 30:19.550
Miss.

30:20.390 --> 30:20.940
Boundaries.

30:30.390 --> 30:31.590
Take a bouquet if you like it.

30:31.910 --> 30:32.510
This one, then.

30:32.790 --> 30:33.310
Take care.

30:37.910 --> 30:38.990
This looks nice.

30:40.710 --> 30:42.790
These bracelets
are called Joyful Hearts.

30:43.030 --> 30:44.510
My husband and I

30:44.630 --> 30:45.630
carved them together.

30:46.430 --> 30:47.670
Joyful Hearts bracelets.

30:48.230 --> 30:49.150
Any special meaning?

30:49.430 --> 30:50.310
If lovers

30:50.510 --> 30:52.790
wear these bracelets,

30:53.030 --> 30:54.390
they'll never be separated.

30:56.550 --> 30:58.150
Is this your lover?

30:59.030 --> 31:00.470
Buy a pair for the lady.

31:00.750 --> 31:01.550
A lifetime

31:01.710 --> 31:02.950
of togetherness.

31:03.870 --> 31:04.870
You heard that, Mr. Liu?

31:05.590 --> 31:06.430
Buy me one?

31:20.110 --> 31:21.230
She's not my lover.

31:28.470 --> 31:30.030
- Great!
- Great!

31:30.230 --> 31:30.910
You sure

31:30.950 --> 31:32.310
I'm not your lover?

31:37.870 --> 31:38.750
No flowers?

31:39.790 --> 31:40.350
No.

31:53.710 --> 31:54.270
It's me.

32:06.350 --> 32:07.670
Soldiers are everywhere outside,

32:07.870 --> 32:08.670
checking everyone.

32:08.990 --> 32:10.390
Seemingly searching for someone.

32:15.430 --> 32:16.190
Tomorrow,

32:17.270 --> 32:18.790
I must return to Qiyun Mountain.

32:19.950 --> 32:21.350
Will you come with me?

32:21.870 --> 32:22.990
You'll meet my master.

32:24.750 --> 32:25.910
I can't go with you.

32:30.470 --> 32:30.990
Why?

32:32.550 --> 32:33.870
I'm Prince Mengji's daughter.

32:35.310 --> 32:37.070
The person those soldiers are hunting

32:38.230 --> 32:38.990
is me.

32:40.550 --> 32:41.230
My father wants

32:41.750 --> 32:42.350
me to marry

32:42.350 --> 32:43.670
a court official's son

32:44.630 --> 32:46.150
to strengthen his political standing.

32:47.390 --> 32:47.910
I refused.

32:47.950 --> 32:48.910
That's why I fled.

32:49.470 --> 32:50.910
But then I met you.

32:52.110 --> 32:53.190
This past month

32:54.190 --> 32:55.870
has been truly joyful.

32:59.630 --> 33:00.350
Mr. Liu,

33:01.350 --> 33:02.430
I don't want that marriage.

33:03.950 --> 33:05.590
But I can't go up the mountain with you.

33:06.510 --> 33:07.470
What should I do?

33:11.710 --> 33:12.270
In that case,

33:12.910 --> 33:14.270
wait here at this inn.

33:14.830 --> 33:15.590
I'll go

33:15.950 --> 33:17.150
tell my master

33:17.550 --> 33:18.710
and then return in two days.

33:19.030 --> 33:20.230
We'll resolve this together.

33:22.270 --> 33:23.430
Must you leave now?

33:24.270 --> 33:25.190
I'll definitely return.

33:25.950 --> 33:26.510
Liu Buwang,

33:28.590 --> 33:29.910
remember your promise.

33:31.670 --> 33:32.710
You must come back.

33:37.590 --> 33:38.230
I will.

34:19.040 --> 34:21.840
♪Through endless nights, I walk alone♪

34:22.050 --> 34:25.690
♪Heartache swirls like ceaseless winds♪

34:29.830 --> 34:32.659
♪Yet I yearn to stand opposed to you♪

34:32.960 --> 34:36.560
♪Seeking fleeting clarity♪

34:37.030 --> 34:40.820
♪Imprisoned within memories♪

34:40.900 --> 34:43.630
♪Upon towering fortress walls♪

34:43.880 --> 34:46.480
♪Brooding over lamented pasts♪

34:46.659 --> 34:49.520
♪Where shall light be found♪

34:51.590 --> 34:53.350
This last peach blossom

34:54.989 --> 34:56.630
has finally withered.

34:57.840 --> 35:00.090
♪Never yield♪

35:00.260 --> 35:02.900
♪I'm shrouded in darkness♪

35:02.990 --> 35:06.300
♪Resent old dreams like drifting clouds♪

35:06.580 --> 35:08.400
♪Fading into oblivion♪

35:08.790 --> 35:09.790
I just want to know

35:11.030 --> 35:12.710
if I ever meant anything to him,

35:14.070 --> 35:15.470
but the answer never came.

35:16.430 --> 35:17.470
Deep down, I know

35:18.350 --> 35:19.070
we are

35:19.070 --> 35:20.110
in separate worlds.

35:20.630 --> 35:22.030
Destined never to meet.

35:22.990 --> 35:23.950
What I want

35:24.390 --> 35:25.990
isn't explanations from him.

35:26.510 --> 35:28.110
I just need him to give our past

35:29.310 --> 35:30.390
a proper ending.

35:33.350 --> 35:34.030
Fate

35:35.350 --> 35:36.470
is truly cruel.

35:38.110 --> 35:39.030
What a pity.

35:39.470 --> 35:41.190
He remains a coward.

35:41.950 --> 35:43.590
Not even brave enough to end things

35:43.590 --> 35:44.110
properly.

35:45.430 --> 35:46.950
My master isn't like that.

35:47.550 --> 35:48.830
There must be reasons.

35:54.350 --> 35:56.350
Time only hastens aging,

35:57.630 --> 35:58.790
heartless to human bonds,

36:00.270 --> 36:01.710
eternally mourning separations.

36:38.930 --> 36:41.090
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

36:41.200 --> 36:45.120
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

36:45.290 --> 36:47.240
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

36:47.330 --> 36:52.260
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

37:04.350 --> 37:05.760
♪I've seen the mountains♪

37:05.960 --> 37:07.380
♪And trodden through ice♪

37:07.640 --> 37:10.460
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

37:10.770 --> 37:12.160
♪Destiny is my creed♪

37:12.220 --> 37:13.620
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

37:13.760 --> 37:15.560
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

37:16.760 --> 37:18.230
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

37:18.400 --> 37:19.690
♪Gazing through the mire♪

37:19.860 --> 37:22.260
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

37:22.450 --> 37:24.500
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

37:25.640 --> 37:27.470
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

37:29.430 --> 37:32.350
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

37:32.440 --> 37:35.100
♪There must always be a longing♪

37:35.550 --> 37:40.620
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

37:40.950 --> 37:42.960
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

37:43.270 --> 37:46.920
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

37:47.150 --> 37:49.050
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

37:49.080 --> 37:52.920
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

37:53.280 --> 37:55.220
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

37:55.400 --> 37:59.220
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

37:59.480 --> 38:05.230
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

38:06.120 --> 38:11.590
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

38:18.740 --> 38:21.660
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

38:21.750 --> 38:24.410
♪There must always be a longing♪

38:24.870 --> 38:29.930
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

38:30.260 --> 38:32.270
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

38:32.590 --> 38:36.230
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

38:36.470 --> 38:38.360
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

38:38.390 --> 38:42.240
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

38:42.590 --> 38:44.530
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

38:44.710 --> 38:48.540
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

38:48.790 --> 38:54.550
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

38:55.430 --> 39:00.900
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪
